WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.442
YOUR PRACTICAL DESTINATION A working agreement people can use

00:00:03.494 --> 00:00:06.297
In this learning activity you will build a clear

00:00:06.376 --> 00:00:10.231
support partnership You will identify the limits of your

00:00:10.271 --> 00:00:13.823
own authority and practise using sound judgement when requests

00:00:13.863 --> 00:00:17.401
compete You will also learn to prepare work that

00:00:17.467 --> 00:00:20.467
meets agreed requirements and to check that another person

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:25.718
has actually accepted any cover assignment Translate priorities into

00:00:25.784 --> 00:00:31.442
reliable support deliverables Distinguish EA coordination from executive and

00:00:31.547 --> 00:00:35.942
specialist decisions Prepare a working agreement and a reasoned

00:00:35.994 --> 00:00:41.744
priority brief Keep uncertainty visible rather than inventing approval
